    "detailed_description": "2018. Early in the morning, Daniel wakes up from an unexpected call. His best friend Dmitry called him with a very unusual request - to collect some stones\u2026<br><br>Daniel is the main character of the game, an ordinary guy living in a small town, unlike Dmitry, who has already managed to achieve the main success in his life - he became the director of the main laboratory of the world.<br><br>Once upon a time Dmitry helped Daniel and now the main character has to help his friend find some stones by going on a crazy and dangerous adventure full of secrets and riddles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main features of the game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Modern and beautiful graphics<br></li><li>Two types of weapons: melee and ranged combat<br></li><li>Dangerous opponents who mimic ordinary people<br></li><li>Locations where you can take a walk and admire the environment<br></li><li>An unpredictable plot that will surprise you very much </li></ul>",
